 cumentary film\, "We're Pregnant\nand Other Lies\," which garnered selectio
 n at prestigious festivals\nincluding the BronzeLens Film Festival\, The Pa
 n African Film Festival\,\nand the Black Girls Rock! Film Festival. She has
